# them); rendered MP4s are not - they are reproducible with
#   uv run main.py video
assets/*.mp4

# --- training scratch ------------------------------------------------------
# Sweep eval histories and results tables ARE committed: they are the evidence
# behind the report's hyperparameter tables. Only raw replay buffers are not.
*.pkl
